\nGRAB is a VR multiplayer parkour game. Climb, jump, slide and swing through the levels to reach the end, but don't fall or touch the lava!\nA core component of GRAB is the level editor that lets you and your friends create your own levels together and upload them for everyone else to play.\n\nFeatures:\n- Active and fun physics based controls\n- Play with up to 16 players in cross platform multiplayer\n- Built-in tutorial levels to get you started as well as some more advanced bigger levels\n- Built-in level editor that lets you build levels together with your friends in multiplayer with quick switching between testing and editing\n- Download levels made by the community and upload your own", "short_description": "GRAB is a VR multiplayer parkour game. Climb, jump, slide and swing through the levels to reach the end, but don't fall or touch the lava!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://slindev.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://slindev.com/terms", "publisher_name": "SlinDev", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://slindev.com/grab", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SOCIAL", "EXPLORATION", "ADVENTURE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "630351748179695"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "473475945549280"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "222566259952082"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "473475945549280"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1723136400, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "473475945549280"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26462189390119248", "version": "0.76.0"}, "id": "1974803902687197", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4104088956355944", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26462189390119248"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1974803902687197"}]}, "change_log": "- Increased complexity limit: default to 2500 (was 2000), verified to 3500 (was 3000) and GRAB+ to 5000 (was 4000)\n- Rebalanced complexity: triggers now cost 3 (was 5), lights 5 (was 10), particle emitters 8 (was 5) and signs 10 (was 5).\n- Most rendering work now runs on a separate CPU thread allowing the next frames game update to run while still rendering the previous frame. This cuts CPU time almost in half, massively improving performance in many situations.\n- Quest 2 and Pico only: Reduced MSAA and anisotropic filtering quality to keep performance stable in GPU intensive scenes.\n- Occlusion culling is now much more aggressive, which helps with performance issues in some case.\n- The in-game camera now supports live streaming through RTMP and RTMPS (tested with youtube and twitch).\n- The in-game camera now keeps the audio in sync with the video and should no longer have the audio cut out.\n- The in-game camera can now see all UI (but it will get very blurry if you are far away from the UI or behind, this is expected and not a bug).\n- The in-game camera can now show triggers, lights and other previously hidden objects in the editor as a setting.\n- The in-game camera now allows to hide all players when used in the editor.\n- The in-game camera can now be triggered by double tapping the A button while in the editor.\n- Code now supports 5 per player shared registers that survive sublevel changes.\n- Code now supports 5 lobby wide shared registers that survive sublevel changes.\n- Made other players see through when close to them.\n- When you have issues with the game, you can now send logs directly from within the game. They are only helpful in combination with a support ticket or bug report on discord though!\n- New lobby!\n- New time limited items in the shop!", "created_date": 1778115096, "id": "26462189390119248", "version": "0.76.0", "version_code": 3637, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4104088956355944", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26462189390119248"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1775437444, "id": "26123746983963492", "version": "0.75.1", "version_code": 3593, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4104088956355944", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26462189390119248"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1974803902687197"}]}, "change_log": "- Fixed a bug that would cause grouped objects positions to not update correctly in code.\n- Color previews on hover are no longer networked, hopefully fixing a problem of other players seeing wrong colors.\n- Implemented a GPU performance improvement, resulting in a higher visual quality outside of the screen center.", "created_date": 1775432316, "id": "26123207624017428", "version": "0.75.1", "version_code": 3589, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4104088956355944", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26462189390119248"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1974803902687197"}]}, "change_log": "- New lobby!\n- New time limited items in the shop!\n- A coding tutorial has been added.\n- The code editor now shows tooltips for a lot of things.\n- Code can now check what player part a trigger was triggered by.\n- It is now possible to add and remove objects inside groups without ungrouping first.\n- It is now possible go into physics groups and make changes.\n- Things inside physics groups that are passable are now allowed to be animated.\n- In code, it is now possible to drag and drop the program counter on a DST slot to write it. (but does not show in the dropdown as this is a more advanced feature)\n- Light properties can now be changed with triggers.\n- Sounds can now be animated.\n- Fixed a bunch of issues around groups and enabling physics.\n- Fixed a bunch of memory leaks.\n- Reduced undo to only undo the last 2000 changes (it was potentially using too much memory before at 100000)\n- Complexity is back to normal.", "created_date": 1775093981, "id": "26079469331724591", "version": "0.75.0", "version_code": 3579, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4104088956355944", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26462189390119248"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1974803902687197"}]}, "change_log": "- You have all been asking for more complexity for years, so I finally decided that it is time: Complexity has been increased 80 times!", "created_date": 1775039432, "id": "26071762259161965", "version": "0.74.1", "version_code": 3571, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}